//--------------------------------
//      Starter NPC
//--------------------------------

title: StarterNPC
---
Applebottom: That was a scary storm, good thing I have legs, OH! Hey there! I know you. You drew us!
You: I remember you, I called you Pants Mackrel
Applebottom: My friends call me Applebottom, for some reason many of us popped out and we like walking around
You: I'm not sure it's safe for you outside the book...
Applebottom: We can help you but in exchange let us walk around and be free to spread our fish legs!
You: Ok, so how can you help me?
Applebottom: I saw some of the doodles fly far off to the neighbour islands, i know there is a boat in the little makeshift dock nearby
Applebottom: You should go talk to the Pants Mackrel there and he might help you use the boat. Don't forget to collect some of my doodle brothers in this island!
You: Ok i'm on it! Thank Applebottom.
<<EnableMovement>>
<<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===


//--------------------------------
//      Questline 1
//--------------------------------
title: Quest1Intro
---
    Macklemor: Oh boy coming out of that book sure was scary, good thing I don't get spooked easy!
    You: Hello?
    Macklemor: AAAAAAAAAHHHHHHHH!  Oh.. Hi!... Dont sneak up on me like that!
    You: Sorry!
    Macklemor: Wait... I know you! You are our creator! Did you really have to draw me besides Doge Fish, he won't stop barking.
    You: Sorry about that... I was actually wondering if you could help me out?
    Macklemor: Oh so you need my help? Well I did get this boat that could be used to travel, how I got it?.... Internet.
    You: Perfect! That will help me!
    Macklemor: Wa wa wa wait! Not so fast. I need to make sure you even are our artist!
    You: What?... You just said you recognized me?
    Macklemor: My fishy eyes could be tricking me!
    Macklemor: I will give you the keys to the boat if you show me you caught all 3 fish found here in Doodlefish Bay.
    You: That makes absolutely no sense but... ok...
    Narrator: QUEST STARTED
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===

title: Quest1Incomplete
---
    Macklemor: I won't give you the keys to the boat until you prove you drew us by showing me you caught all 3 fishes!
    You: How does me catching my doodles prove I drew them?
    Narrator: Macklemor got distracted looking at the floor as you asked for explanations.
    You: Ok nevermind i'll get the fish 
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===


title: Quest1Complete
---
    Macklemor: I knew you drew us! And this proves it!
    You: ...
    Macklemor: I never had any doubts about you
    You: Can I have the boat keys?
    Macklemor: The what now?
    You:...
    Narrator: You grab the keys laying on the ground besides Macklemor and decide to move on.
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===


//--------------------------------
//      Questline 2
//--------------------------------
title: Quest2Intro
---
    Omega The Third: I hate this island, I want some sand and I want the beach vibes
    You: Hello?
    Omega The Third: Oh look who arrived! Macklemor said you would be here soon.
    You: How did you two communicate?
    Omega The Third: Erm... Internet?
    You: Right.. so, i'm trying to find the other fish doodles and I see you have a boat there.
    Omega The Third: Indeed I do, and with this one you dont have to go around the island and risk hitting the rocky shores
    You: But let me guess, you want me to do a que...
    Omega The Third: QUESTLINE!
    You:…st. I knew talking to a fish in pants would lead here.
    Omega The Third: My brothers in the nearby river wanted to check the beach with me but I can't fish them out only with legs
    Omega The Third: Please go get them so we can all go on this trip.
    You: Should be easy! Ok see you in a bit

    Narrator: QUEST STARTED
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===

title: Quest2Incomplete
---
    Omega The Third: I cant wait to go to the beach! I love the summer vibes.
    You: You are so lucky you are a doodle
    Omega The Third: Why? What's wrong with the beach?
    You: You cant bring yourself to tell Omega the reality of fish under the sun so you go back to finishing your quest
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===

title: Quest2Complete
---
    Omega The Third: WOOO all of the doodles are here! I even got my sunscreen ready.
    You: Is that laminated paper?
    Omega The Third: Ya! Can't get too tanned! Let's go, here are the keys. The beach is WAITING!
    You: Wait... Can't you just swim there? You are a doodle fish
    Omega The Third: Omega The Third: I would, but I’m wearing pants. These are not swim-pants. These are beach pants.
    You: They look like brown jeans but I can't argue I suppose.
    <<EnableMovement>>
    <<StopSound LinePresenter>>
===





